                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "212fa87a-6e5d-42b6-86ad-921aa49e09f9",
                        "source_entry_id": "d084456b-1dc5-38f7-af7f-ace1cb831106",
                        "source_sense_id": "dcf50078-e385-3e18-82c4-0603760d31a6",
                        "target_lang_word": "bustle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bustle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0718f116-0f01-3537-9f7c-f37bd1a29242",
                                        "entry_id": "3c44ada7-2d2c-3c19-b1ad-d92f3260b2aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An excited activity; a stir."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26b20fba-a7c8-497b-8aee-733746e4e294",
                                                "sense_id": "0718f116-0f01-3537-9f7c-f37bd1a29242",
                                                "text": "In the midſt of all this buſtle, I was ſtruck with the appearance of a large bevy of beauties and women of the firſt fashion, who with all the perfect confidence of good breeding, inſhrined themſelves in the ſeveral temples dedicated to the Cyprian Venus[.]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83947a97-bb0d-4741-b86a-bfc760fbcb45",
                                                "sense_id": "0718f116-0f01-3537-9f7c-f37bd1a29242",
                                                "text": "we are, perhaps, all the while flattering our natural indolence, which, hating the bustle of the world, and drudgery of business seeks a pretence of reason to give itself a full and uncontrolled indulgence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6681b38a-a822-3b3e-a584-3c40c3358e00",
                                        "entry_id": "3c44ada7-2d2c-3c19-b1ad-d92f3260b2aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cover to protect and hide the back panel of a computer or other office machine."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9268e8b4-497a-3090-a54e-13bad678d693",
                                        "entry_id": "3c44ada7-2d2c-3c19-b1ad-d92f3260b2aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A frame worn underneath a woman's skirt, typically only protruding from the rear as opposed to the earlier more circular hoops."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc9a110b-58eb-4fb4-ab23-eda944c5eaed",
                                                "sense_id": "9268e8b4-497a-3090-a54e-13bad678d693",
                                                "text": "All the portraits that hang on the walls of the living room are, I realize, of my mother's family: miniatures of her great-aunts in Victorian bustles and elaborate feathered hats; a gilt-framed oil of her great-great-great-uncle as a boy in pastoral England, wearing a gold riding coat over white jodhpurs and sitting astride a white steed, a King Charles spaniel yapping at them from the foreground of the canvas."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bustle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "790072e6-a4cc-3786-bffd-f6e756b1c6f2",
                                        "entry_id": "20ad084f-ca1d-3973-9ca0-c143971c0f3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To move busily and energetically with fussiness (often followed by about)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c341664-d506-4ea4-8af5-c00eecea49d2",
                                                "sense_id": "790072e6-a4cc-3786-bffd-f6e756b1c6f2",
                                                "text": "The commuters bustled about inside the train station."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61196184-155b-4e59-ade5-b2baec05a93d",
                                                "sense_id": "790072e6-a4cc-3786-bffd-f6e756b1c6f2",
                                                "text": "I was once so mad to bussell abroad, and seek about for preferment […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e427dae0-b605-392e-abbf-d4682ebe7455",
                                        "entry_id": "20ad084f-ca1d-3973-9ca0-c143971c0f3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To teem or abound (usually followed by with); to exhibit an energetic and active abundance (of a thing)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f874ee3-cdbd-4fbe-8a9f-11767b692fe3",
                                                "sense_id": "e427dae0-b605-392e-abbf-d4682ebe7455",
                                                "text": "The train station was bustling with commuters."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d91af679-37f3-3d90-be43-ba54606a8b84",
                                        "entry_id": "20ad084f-ca1d-3973-9ca0-c143971c0f3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To push around, to importune."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57a89d1d-f98f-4597-83bd-203a1b556dbc",
                                                "sense_id": "d91af679-37f3-3d90-be43-ba54606a8b84",
                                                "text": "Don’t bustle her or fuss or snatch: / A suitor looking at his watch / Is not a posture that persuades / Willing, much less reluctant maids."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4ac2ce98-ca21-470c-b865-3dd98b70fac1",
                        "source_entry_id": "d084456b-1dc5-38f7-af7f-ace1cb831106",
                        "source_sense_id": "dcf50078-e385-3e18-82c4-0603760d31a6",
                        "target_lang_word": "hustle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hustle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ca77ba4-6f99-3c76-9f10-20c57a086538",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To push someone roughly; to crowd; to jostle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "847581f9-c6cf-494e-bb48-e08457025244",
                                                "sense_id": "1ca77ba4-6f99-3c76-9f10-20c57a086538",
                                                "text": "There is an hour or two, after the passengers have embarked, which is disquieting and fussy.[…]Passengers wander restlessly about or hurry, with futile energy, from place to place. Pushing men hustle each other at the windows of the purser's office, under pretence of expecting letters or despatching telegrams."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "243327b6-8149-3e62-b0d9-031401d9c858",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To rush or hurry."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "480cda60-d7e4-40f7-8732-722cde3910b7",
                                                "sense_id": "243327b6-8149-3e62-b0d9-031401d9c858",
                                                "text": "I'll have to hustle to get there on time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bbb0907-86af-4e09-a22a-a04ba68b8fe4",
                                                "sense_id": "243327b6-8149-3e62-b0d9-031401d9c858",
                                                "text": "Men in dairy lunches were hustling to gulp down the food which cooks had hustled to fry"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e9958b12-2d52-35e4-9cb8-20069bb50c8d",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bundle; to stow something quickly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c527103-79a5-41df-81a7-3c6abe47048b",
                                                "sense_id": "e9958b12-2d52-35e4-9cb8-20069bb50c8d",
                                                "text": "There was a person called Nana who ruled the nursery. Sometimes she took no notice of the playthings lying about, and sometimes, for no reason whatever, she went swooping about like a great wind and hustled them away in cupboards."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "82f25e72-aafc-348c-b2a3-1287b7dab230",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To con, swindle, or deceive, especially financially."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b979da76-421d-4d28-bcdb-2206ae299d03",
                                                "sense_id": "82f25e72-aafc-348c-b2a3-1287b7dab230",
                                                "text": "The guy tried to hustle me into buying into a bogus real estate deal."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c0796454-1415-3093-8c08-5e4bd1d35194",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To play deliberately badly at a game or sport in an attempt to encourage players to challenge one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71826813-688e-39f7-89f1-bdf4fafb5ba1",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To obtain by illicit or forceful action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c2e2789-497a-302b-b0f8-dcc219b484da",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To sell sex; to work as a pimp."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e12c3dbd-d523-3cc4-9e96-ccccd6b41c50",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be a prostitute; to exchange use of one's body for sexual purposes for money."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cd52080-c854-4814-b826-e7ac57513f5a",
                                                "sense_id": "e12c3dbd-d523-3cc4-9e96-ccccd6b41c50",
                                                "text": "All my life, been hustling / And tonight is my appraisal / 'Cause I'm a hooker selling songs / And my pimp's a record label"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c730a09b-d7e4-3ff8-9265-caa2c710b871",
                                        "entry_id": "eed382a9-70dd-3da1-ae56-21cdc4a6b6c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To serve (a clientele) as a prostitute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd1b6d27-d09a-4345-8902-e2c0943f23b7",
                                                "sense_id": "c730a09b-d7e4-3ff8-9265-caa2c710b871",
                                                "text": "When I was in Morocco I wrote this play (\"Playland Blues\") about young kids who […] hustle old gay men and closet queens."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a930417c-a926-338a-992a-bb368c4e4374",
